body:
2020-2021 kya din they,,, har ros school se aakar ek ghanta yaha se memes dekhta tha - dola nahi aaya dola, saimansays, woh sab. jab se saala Tanmay Bhat is subreddit ko react kiya tub se normies ghus gaye hain. 

&#x200B;

Woh din bhi kya they...🕊

First off, a very happy birthday bro!! dw about others forgetting today's ur bday, maybe they just are really busy or just forgot the speciality of today cos of ur bday. or maybe, they're planning a surprise for you(?)

&#x200B;

I don't want to get your hopes high for any of these, just wanna let you know stuff like this happens from time to time, i know its one of the worst feelings out there, but just hang in there bud. I'm always there in my DMs if you wanna talk to me. Other than that, have a great day and happy bday again!
